    <node id="&quot;GEOFF COOK&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Geoff Cook, also known as Geoffrey Cook, is a former English cricketer who played in Tests and ODIs from 1981 to 1983. He was born on 9 October 1951 in Middlesbrough, Yorkshire, and later played for Northamptonshire where he achieved a notable second wicket partnership."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0204-6ddba5a79d41</data>
    </node>
